  "details": "A cool feature would be to have a unique identifier that you can copy via in the inventory and looking further in item details (or binding it to a custom name that you set on the item) to spawn or despawn something that you have in your inventory\n\nExample\n\nI have the frosted scribe item\n\nI would either copy a Unique ID it has, or just bind it to a parameter called \"pen\"\n\nTo spawn the item, you'd send the parameter \"inventory/items/pen\" with the boolean, \"TRUE\", and it would spawn in front of you just like that.",
